    "general": "One scenarios_build; baseline/fallback scenario0, ordinary ability_list_evaluate scenario1. Complement diagnostic is not an automatic second general list.",
    "lists": "Original human order Attack, primary, secondary, Frog; 34 packed entries, optional skillset255 terminator. Duplicates retain slot identity. Ordinary spell catalog is a subset.",
